{
    "word": "monarchy",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "8ddc6feb-1fa0-3ea4-8ed5-740d70eda65e",
                "word": "monarchy",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "94fb3e30-5b3f-4381-8f35-fecd969b4484",
                        "entry_id": "8ddc6feb-1fa0-3ea4-8ed5-740d70eda65e",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "monarchies"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fb738d75-caf9-3838-a597-97251cecaafc",
                        "entry_id": "8ddc6feb-1fa0-3ea4-8ed5-740d70eda65e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A government in which sovereignty is embodied within a single, today usually hereditary head of state (whether as a figurehead or as a powerful ruler)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "64299203-7db8-4fdb-9293-885924109408",
                                "sense_id": "fb738d75-caf9-3838-a597-97251cecaafc",
                                "text": "An absolute monarchy is a monarchy where the monarch is legally the ultimate authority in all temporal matters."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "51c550e9-1a86-4173-aa0d-cd79914f50b5",
                                "sense_id": "fb738d75-caf9-3838-a597-97251cecaafc",
                                "text": "A constitutional monarchy is a monarchy in which the monarch's power is legally constrained, ranging from where minor concessions have been made to appease certain factions to where the monarch is a figurehead with all real power in the hands of a legislative body."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "af956d90-6f87-4edd-bb94-589a289488a0",
                                "sense_id": "fb738d75-caf9-3838-a597-97251cecaafc",
                                "text": "He that with ſhepheards and a litle ſpoyle,\nDurſt in diſdaine of wrong and tyrannie,\nDefend his freedome gainſt a Monarchie:\nWhat will he doe ſupported by a king?"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "94b6c5d9-d4a7-3ccc-bdb6-d4e3152be93d",
                        "entry_id": "8ddc6feb-1fa0-3ea4-8ed5-740d70eda65e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The territory ruled over by a monarch; a kingdom."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1777486f-f965-423e-b8f0-9b79ae875a5c",
                                "sense_id": "94b6c5d9-d4a7-3ccc-bdb6-d4e3152be93d",
                                "text": "What scourge for perjury / Can this dark monarchy afford false Clarence?"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d1b1bb59-a340-347a-a496-fb494dd409e7",
                        "entry_id": "8ddc6feb-1fa0-3ea4-8ed5-740d70eda65e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A form of government where sovereignty is embodied by a single ruler in a state and his high aristocracy representing their separate divided lands within the state and their low aristocracy representing their separate divided fiefs."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d61afede-0911-3fca-915e-96d8e647f69b",
                        "entry_id": "8ddc6feb-1fa0-3ea4-8ed5-740d70eda65e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "States based on a system of governance headed by a king or a queen."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
